# Micro typography floor

- **Never ship UI copy at 10px or smaller** (`text-[10px]`, `text-[9px]`, `text-[8px]`, or equivalent `font-size`).
- **Ideal XSmall is 12px** (`text-xs`). Use this for captions, dense meta, uppercase section labels, and campaign card micro labels.
- **11px (`text-[11px]`) is the absolute minimum** — counters, compact filter pills, tier tags only when 12px truly will not fit.
- Prefer tokens in `src/lib/ui/surface-styles.ts` (`sectionDescription`, `captionHeading`, `tableHeaderCell`, `brandChipCount`, `proNavTag`, `edgeNavTag`, `filterPillState`) over ad-hoc pixel sizes.
- Inline icons in lock-ups with XSmall text should track the type (typically `size-3`, not `size-2.5`). Decorative chrome (tooltip arrows, non-text gutters) is exempt.
- Full note: `docs/design-system.md` → “Type scale floor (micro copy)”.
